<title>INDIA: LATEST INDIA RECOMMENDATIONS FOR BOMBAY STOCKS.</title>
<headline>LATEST INDIA RECOMMENDATIONS FOR BOMBAY STOCKS.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are the latest recommendations from 11 leading Indian securities firms on stocks which make up the benchmark 30-share index of the Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE).</p>
<p>RECOMMENDATIONS: B =BUY, S =SELL, H =HOLD</p>
<p>Note: OP-Out performer, UP-Under performer,</p>
<p>N-Neutral, MP-Market performer, SOR-Sell on rise, BOD-Buy on</p>
<p>decline, LTB-Long term buy</p>
<p>----</p>
<p>	  CS - Caspian Research	     NH - NH Securities</p>
